      "message": "It would be great to move to full mode as the default. However, it might that apps update their keep rules. The only way I can think about figuring out how much will fail will be to make full mode default and submit a CL to see what fails. That was how we replaced Proguard with R8 in the first place (and took 7 rollbacks before the last bugs where found). Unless there has been \"TAP blobal presumbit\" features added to the Android Platform or Forrest can do more these days.\n\nFor a bit more info on what full mode does see the answer to this: https://stackoverflow.com/questions/58726616/what-really-r8-full-mode-do-aggressive-optimizations\n\nAlso see b/165804246 for reference on what the effect of full mode can be.",
