      "writtenOn": "2020-09-10T09:40:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s use Proguard_compatibility. I don\u0027t think it makes a big difference if we change the default of Proguard_compatibility to false or the default of Full_mode to true in the future, but it may be more clear to users that Proguard_compatibility\u003dtrue can have a negative impact on the build, whereas it is not very clear what Full_mode\u003dtrue does (without knowing R8 well).\n\n(It was not clear to me if there is a better way to set the default to true than to check for the nil value, please let me know if this is not the right way.)",
